        "z": "c3a4b13122fa4601",
        "name": "Info",
        "info": "ID and Display Mode select provide no useful functionality to this NR ui.  \nCall sign ID info is redundent unless more than one LP100's are in use.\nThe LP-100 has many display options that can not be used by NodeRed due \nto limited data payload from the LP100 and limited control option provide \nto the remote interface options of the LP100.\nYou will need to configure the node red serial port name",
        "x": 90,
        "y": 120,
        "wires": []
